        "original_id": "c9293439-edd0-59be-b6b3-629c762ba351",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Neringa Municipality, Klaipėda County, Lithuania, Curonian Spit, Pervalka\n- Systems: Municipalities of Lithuania, elderships\n\nFacts:\n- Lithuania is subdivided into 60 municipalities, called savivaldybės in Lithuanian.\n- Lithuania’s municipalities are further subdivided into over 500 elderships, called seniūnijos in Lithuanian.\n- Neringa Municipality, also called Neringa or Neringos savivaldybė in Lithuanian, is a municipality in Klaipėda County in westernmost Lithuania.\n- Neringa Municipality comprises several villages on the Curonian Spit.\n- Pervalka is administratively part of the city of Neringa.",
